	(text "±2.5 mA current drive with 4.7k\n\nIf connecting SENSEP to VOUT after\nthe current limit resistor, the\nactual current limit could be more\nlike ±250 uA.\n\nCurrent demands of PMN-PT piezo:\n1.6 nF, 2.3 nm/V, 24 V\n250 uA, 0.156 V/us, 0.359 mm/s\n\nCompare to LiNbO3 kinematic mount:\n0.7 nF, 0.48 nm/V, 850 V\n21 mA, 30 V/us, 14.4 mm/s"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 94.996 21.844 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "656f475d-752c-4d0c-a328-f26c5116e0e6")
	)
	(text "In the DC regime, current across the\nlimiter resistor should be ~0 when\nthe load capacitor is fully charged.\n\nDelay in response while capacitor charges:\n4.7k, 1.6 nF ± 15% first order RC filter\n21.2 kHz ± 15%\n5 time constants (0.7% settling) in 38 us\n10 time constants (0.004% settling) in 75 us\n\nTime to cross range at 3.59 mm/s:\n15.4 us, 65k half cycles/second\n\nTime to cross range at 0.359 mm/s:\n154 us, 6.5k half cycles/second"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 141.478 21.082 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a66bd7a0-4196-4e19-8446-4913a8249331")
	)
